id: R02
target: src/sello/ristretto.nim
desc: ristrettoDecode: negative-s reject term inverted, 'sNegative' -> '(not sNegative)' in the verdict combine -- rejects nonnegative s and accepts negative s instead, the opposite of RFC 9496 §4.3.1 step 2. RFC-004 slice 8b.
====OLD====
  if (not canonical) or sNegative or (not wasSquare) or tNegative or yZero:
====NEW====
  if (not canonical) or (not sNegative) or (not wasSquare) or tNegative or yZero:
====END====
